WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,140
Jian Jianyu cooperated well with that girl

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,140
I just read the rules of Class S

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,140
They are not allowed to go together

4
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:08,140
Then the tactics formulated are reasonable.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,140
Original salary is also acceptable

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,140
Value teammates

7
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,140
Ability to make decisions quickly after seeing the crime clearly

8
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:18,480
They are all good teachers

9
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,480
That woman said she was Class B

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,480
I don't believe it

11
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,480
She must be hiding her strength

12
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,480
She even threw her shoes at me

13
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,480
Finally hit my alarm with a snap lock

14
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,480
I don't want to quit

15
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,860
If you can't beat someone, you'll suspect that they're hiding their strength.

16
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,860
You should hide one for me to see

17
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,860
I also doubt that you are not Class B.

18
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,860
Maybe it's C-level

19
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:34,990
I wanted to go back and scold you again

20
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:37,990
I wouldn't be happy if I had to find you here

21
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:38,990
If you finally go out

22
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:39,990
Remember to hand the gun to Class B

23
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:40,990
That's all there is to count

24
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,570
You dare to go up even if you haven't polished your bottom yet.

25
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,570
Eliminate a few people from Class A

26
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,570
Invisible water, are you floating?

27
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,980
Also Class B

28
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,810
No need to be out this time

29
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:53,810
Went down again
